          "For an application-preparation page, show an illustrative first-contact note and explain why each detail helps. Contrast public portfolio information with documents that belong only in a designated verification process. State the scope of your knowledge. If you inspected the public inquiry form, describe that observation without implying that you completed account approval. Original work can consist of careful explanation; it does not require inventing a personal success story or pretending to have used an unavailable feature."
