          "Use an illustrative page review with three questions. Can a reader identify what to prepare? Can they see which information remains uncertain? Can they tell what will happen after the button? If any answer is unclear, edit the content before changing the button color. The x3STAR /partners route, for example, accepts publisher inquiries for Admin review. Describing it as instant affiliate enrollment would misstate the action even if the link itself worked."
